WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Ever promised yourself you'd meditate for an hour—
then couldn't find ten minutes?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A practice that fits an ordinary day may be more useful
than a perfect routine you never begin.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Try sixty seconds: listen, notice your attention wander,
and return. No score.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Zen12 offers twelve-minute audio sessions in several styles.
Its dramatic brainwave claims need more evidence than a sales page.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Final Vestige examines the sources, the limits and the alternatives.
Our future qualifying product links may earn us a commission.
